SRC-EXT-LIVE-0009,PEER-REVIEWED / PRIMARY RESEARCH,PEER_REVIEWED,Väätäjä et al. / ACM,Happy Dogs and Happy Owners: Using Dog Activity Monitoring Technology in Everyday Life,2018,https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3295598.3295607,2026-08-26,Live primary-source verification for Batch 1 Observation/privacy evidence repair,,NOT CAPTURED — LIVE SOURCE,LIVE PEER-REVIEWED SOURCE VERIFIED 2026-08-26 — LIMITATIONS DISCLOSED,Exploratory HCI evidence: interviews n=7 and online questionnaire n=35; small convenience/self-report samples do not establish population prevalence or EMOPET validation.,1
SRC-EXT-LIVE-0010,PEER-REVIEWED / PRIMARY RESEARCH,PEER_REVIEWED,Frontiers in Veterinary Science / primary authors,Do dog behavioural characteristics predict the dog-owner relationship? Wearable activity and owner-reported affect study,2021,https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/veterinary-science/articles/10.3389/fvets.2021.673407/full,2026-08-26,Live primary-source verification for Batch 1 Observation/privacy evidence repair,,NOT CAPTURED — LIVE SOURCE,LIVE PEER-REVIEWED SOURCE VERIFIED 2026-08-26 — LIMITATIONS DISCLOSED,Natural-setting observational study of 19 dogs/owners over two weeks. Activity is not direct welfare or happiness evidence; owner affect ratings are subjective; correlation is not causation; small active-volunteer sample and diary limitations apply.,1
