SRC-EXT-LIVE-0013,PEER-REVIEWED / PRIMARY RESEARCH,PEER_REVIEWED,den Uijl et al. / PLOS ONE,External validation of a collar-mounted accelerometer for canine behaviours,2017,https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0188481,2026-08-26,Live primary-source verification for Batch 1 Observation/privacy evidence repair,,NOT CAPTURED — LIVE SOURCE,LIVE PEER-REVIEWED SOURCE VERIFIED 2026-08-26 — LIMITATIONS DISCLOSED,"Validation is device-, behaviour-, population- and condition-specific (51 healthy dogs over 10 kg). Zoetis partnership funding and Oggii salary support are disclosed. This does not validate all wearables or EMOPET.",1
