SRC-EXT-LIVE-0015,OFFICIAL COMPETITOR,COMPETITOR_CLAIM,Fi / Fi Tracking,Behavior Tracking support,Live support page accessed 2026-08-26,https://support.fitracking.com/hc/en-us/articles/41323083410067-Behavior-Tracking,2026-08-26,Live primary-source verification for Batch 1 Observation/privacy evidence repair,,NOT CAPTURED — LIVE SOURCE,LIVE OFFICIAL COMPETITOR SUPPORT SOURCE VERIFIED 2026-08-26,Official support claim only. Transmission may be delayed 1–2 hours and depends on connection/context; some behaviours are not captured during active movement and device position affects accuracy.,1
