SRC-EXT-LIVE-0018,OFFICIAL COMPETITOR,COMPETITOR_CLAIM,Tractive / Whistle support,Transitioning from Whistle to Tractive — latest updates,Live page accessed 2026-08-26,https://help.tractive.com/hc/en-us/articles/28276056243730-Transitioning-from-Whistle-to-Tractive-Latest-updates,2026-08-26,Live primary-source verification for Batch 1 Observation/privacy evidence repair,,NOT CAPTURED — LIVE SOURCE,LIVE OFFICIAL COMPETITOR LIFECYCLE SOURCE VERIFIED 2026-08-26,"Official support/lifecycle claim. The transition offer ended 2025-09-30 and whistle.com redirects to Tractive; older Whistle claims must be treated as historical, not current competitor capability evidence.",1
SRC-EXT-LIVE-0019,PEER-REVIEWED / PRIMARY RESEARCH,PEER_REVIEWED,Kang et al. / Proceedings on Privacy Enhancing Technologies,Pets without PETs: On Pet Owners' Under-estimation of Privacy Concerns in Pet Wearables,2020,https://crysp.petsymposium.org/popets/2020/popets-2020-0009.pdf,2026-08-26,Live primary-source verification for Batch 1 Observation/privacy evidence repair,,NOT CAPTURED — LIVE SOURCE,LIVE PEER-REVIEWED SOURCE VERIFIED 2026-08-26 — LIMITATIONS DISCLOSED,"Study compares 8,038 pet-wearable reviews with 20,431 human-wearable reviews and reports a survey of 201 participants. Historical review/self-report evidence does not show that risk is low; fewer expressed concerns may reflect functionality or emotional priorities.",1
